Warehouse COSMIC is an independent Rust/libcosmic application inspired by
flattool/Warehouse (https://github.com/flattool/warehouse), GPL-3.0-or-later.
Its five-page organization and snapshot interchange format follow Warehouse.
The application icon is original SVG artwork created for this project.

The application-private fallback theme contains Cosmic Icons by System76,
https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-icons, licensed under CC-BY-SA-4.0.
Its source revision, modifications and license are included beside the icons.

The optional, repo-only KDE Plasma test helper (warehouse-cosmic-kde, built
with the kde-tools feature and never shipped in the app) uses the pure Rust
reis library, licensed under MIT; its notice is in
resources/licenses/reis-MIT.txt. https://github.com/ids1024/reis

The standalone CLI's command discovery, descriptions, script format and JSON
schema conventions were informed by storytold's Craft applications:
https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft/blob/11bb67386c9bb19b0717e21e98adc608162ae2e5/docs/cli.md
https://github.com/storytold/deckcraft/blob/55e5ee56b4b2c64973b78fda4182a78f9766fa62/apps/deckcraft-cli/src/help.rs
No Craft source code is included in the application.
